<SiteLayout current="methodology" title="Methodology" description="The admission test, evidence standard, disqualifiers, and revocation policy behind every Platonic Ideal declaration.">
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="editorial-hero">
      <p class="label">The governing method</p>
      <h1 class="editorial-title">The standard before the object.</h1>
      <p class="editorial-dek">The register does not ask which product is popular, fashionable, or best for a segment. It asks whether one object approaches the stable Form of its category—and whether the evidence can survive scrutiny.</p>
      <p class="methodology-authority"><a href="../constitution/">Read the full Constitution <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a> · the normative authority for every case and ruling.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="method-grid">
      <nav class="method-nav" aria-label="Methodology sections">
        <a href="#rule">01 · The rule</a>
        <a href="#admission">02 · Admission</a>
        <a href="#evidence">03 · Evidence</a>
        <a href="#empty">04 · Emptiness</a>
